{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/17daa5998081a5da11dd7a87c4ccb5fb.avif?t=1753617094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras_big/17daa5998081a5da11dd7a87c4ccb5fb.avif?t=1753617094 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Ape: Rise of the Monke \u2013 Two Minds, One Monkey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique <strong>co-op climbing game</strong>, full control is in your and your friend\u2019s hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Control a single monkey as a duo!</strong> <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Overcome challenging levels with unique mechanics and reach the top! </strong><br> <br> <br><strong> </strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/63e3ae6d39366f89ba8ca8bff3e5f343.poster.avif?t=1753617094\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/63e3ae6d39366f89ba8ca8bff3e5f343.webm?t=1753617094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/63e3ae6d39366f89ba8ca8bff3e5f343.mp4?t=1753617094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single or Multiplayer Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play completely solo or share control with a friend!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>See Your Steam Friends' Latest Heights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your friends' progress and challenge them to climb higher!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/4a13ab717544d6eab09e5d0df7dc5f5a.poster.avif?t=1753617094\" width=616 height=30 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/4a13ab717544d6eab09e5d0df7dc5f5a.webm?t=1753617094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/4a13ab717544d6eab09e5d0df7dc5f5a.mp4?t=1753617094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Different Difficulty Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> Checkpoints are active. The timer is disabled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Mode:</strong> Checkpoints are disabled. The timer is active.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 In <strong>Hardcore Mode</strong>, your completion time is recorded on the <strong>leaderboard</strong> after every successful climb!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steam Leaderboard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish the game in Hardcore Mode to secure your place on the leaderboard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uniquely Designed Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level introduces new mechanics and obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb to the top alone or with a friend, and reach the ultimate peak!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600150?t=1753617094","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/36780179596ad7284a79e865a4a117add9d11591/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753617094","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/94ab2c6ea24c911ecaea66d995916c9a34f2c5e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753617094","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c